sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant O as Order Service
    participant S as Saga Orchestrator
    participant B as Message Broker
    participant I as Inventory Service
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant G as Gateway Externo

    C->>O: POST /orders (Idempotency-Key) [sync]
    O->>O: Cria pedido PENDING + outbox (OrderCreated)
    O-->>C: 202 Accepted (order_id)
    O->>B: OrderCreated
    B->>S: OrderCreated
    S->>S: Cria saga (STARTED)
    S->>B: Cmd ReserveStock(saga_id, order_id)
    B->>I: ReserveStock
    I->>I: Reserva estoque (tx local + inbox/outbox)
    I->>B: StockReserved
    B->>S: StockReserved
    S->>S: Estado = STOCK_RESERVED
    S->>B: Cmd ProcessPayment(saga_id, order_id, valor)
    B->>P: ProcessPayment
    P->>G: Autoriza pagamento (idempotency key = saga_id+step) [sync]
    G-->>P: Aprovado
    P->>B: PaymentApproved
    B->>S: PaymentApproved
    S->>S: Estado = PAYMENT_APPROVED
    S->>B: Cmd ApproveOrder
    B->>O: ApproveOrder
    O->>O: Pedido = APPROVED
    O->>B: OrderApproved
    B->>S: OrderApproved
    S->>S: Estado = COMPLETED
